            <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,10" HorizontalAlignment="Left">Minimum allowed distance between the centers of the infill strands. Strands that are closer will be cut off.<LineBreak/> Minimum allowed length of the infill strands. Shorter parts will be skipped or if possible connected with other ones.</TextBlock>

