                        <Span BaselineAlignment="Center">Different patterns for different layers are possible, too. For that use the</Span>
                        <Span BaselineAlignment="Top"><Grid Background="White"><Image Source="{StaticResource backspace_add_up_slate}" Height="15" Margin="2"/></Grid></Span>
